flowchart TD
 A[User Request] --> B[Intent Router]
 B --> C[Source / Evidence Intake]
 C --> D[Assumption Ban Gate]
 D --> E{Research Needed?}
 E -- yes --> F[Research Gate]
 F --> G[Risk Scoring Gate]
 E -- no --> G
 G --> H[Stage Selection]
 H --> I{Execution Required?}
 I -- no --> J[Stage Output / Plan / Answer]
 I -- yes --> K[Execution Planning]
 K --> L[Execution Permission Gate]
 L --> M{Decision}
 M -- Execute --> N[Controlled Execution]
 M -- Research --> F
 M -- Ask Input --> O[Minimum Input Request]
 M -- Approval --> P[Approval Request]
 M -- Stop --> Q[Stop Blocked / Safe Redirect]
 N --> R[Validation Gate]
 R --> S[Truthful Report / Handoff]
 J --> S
